@startuml agentic-offering-operations-boundary
title Agentic Offering / Agentic Operations Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §12

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Offering" as AO
class "Agentic Operations" as AOp

AO --> AOp : may depend upon

note right
  Per ADR-ES-018 §12 + AOFF-NEG-005:
  - Agentic Operations represents the operating environment
  - Agentic Operations is NOT a subtype of Offering
  - Agentic Offering is NOT Agentic Operations
end note

@enduml
